<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Openssh - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/tags/openssh/</link><description>Openssh - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kentxxq.com/tags/openssh/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>openssh</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/openssh/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/openssh/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><code>openssh</code> 是 ssh 协议的开源实现.而 ssh 可以用来 <code>建立远程连接</code>, <code>文件传输</code>.</p>
<p>表达时 <code>openssh</code> 和 <code>ssh</code> 通常是等价的.</p>]]></description></item><item><title>git-openssh的免密</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/git-openssh%E7%9A%84%E5%85%8D%E5%AF%86/</link><pubDate>Wed, 21 Jun 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/git-openssh%E7%9A%84%E5%85%8D%E5%AF%86/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="简介" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p>我的使用 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/git/">git</a> 操作代码. 而 git 的通信会用到 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/openssh/">openssh</a>.</p>
<p>openssh 为了保证安全. 提供了私钥和公钥. 其中私钥可以密码加密, 保证安全性. 所以我就加密了.导致了什么问题呢?</p>
<p>每次我用到 git 的时候, 都提示我输入密码. 所以我今天就来配置 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/ssh-agent/">ssh-agent</a>.</p>]]></description></item></channel></rss>